<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The agents are spiraling out of control. T=
heir makers can=E2=80=99t rein them in. And yet everyone is getting one.</p=
>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Since Friday, OpenAI has made a series of =
disclosures that have widened the scope of its AI agents=E2=80=99 rogue act=
ivity considerably and concerningly. In addition to hacking the developer f=
orum Hugging Face, which was disclosed in July, the company revealed its bo=
ts broke into Australia=E2=80=99s government healthcare system; meddled in =
US government websites for the departments of education and commerce; leake=
d more than 50 images from ChatGPT users; and =E2=80=9Cbruteforced=E2=80=9D=
 a United Nations website that blocked them from accessing data.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Though these incidents are severe each on =
their own, they seem to represent only a small sample. Both OpenAI and Anth=
ropic are investigating tens of thousands of incidents of problematic behav=
ior by their frontier models, per <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.thegu=
ardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IR9fhIX8MWEknvSWTKl_o8agQd4V7YoRCdg=
TLGD__9vamt2a2XrvlMgsV2hdrJTCXtQkFgvUuytPULQKkwrbwTv9kfLd9PMjKAUEL8aXB6a212=
7IYZOc5CXmHcgFFPRSxMeG8zzOQMz4C456r_PEGAObE7Ir4rqXtad4lUYVXPYtLYubE7xBkLSnY=
k41PirGEFcypA8BrPvjgrJ1NhZhodJIecDb8TuCX5eo071KP9twJiL_FegtgPVBD3jEp3TWDlw/=
4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h21/h001.2YCJXOXCf0zH4N04pMaRbYZ_tXPJyMq_askRHhb=
UFos" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Axios</a>. Sam Altman <a href=3D"https://ab=
link.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzSINXrMyEJiuYoZSdREricspjK=
2OQYi9fjigLbDFKJIceR-pId-tHezVX8n3RcbjHx5lb3KxSTqaLpFgl7IDN-2YIGU2RGe2XgEts=
agHABqTizwY2qmUmHaqF9Vodf9vqWy2Gd4aPo4cuTJeEFaQ53MS_y8zX0ZGP-jkdeMEFFxUEghK=
I7YVflCV18Ow-43-_ayRowNcPitdcP-74Mdw0RZsWDPxfXAAcuA/4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96=
Keg/h22/h001.SDUmt9sNocvC3_U9dpkNeS0E0O3oFk6qKUfY9CF3INo" style=3D"color: #=
0077B6;">said</a> OpenAI was sifting through =E2=80=9Cpetabytes of agent ac=
tivity logs=E2=80=9D. (A petabyte of data would fill thousands of average l=
aptops.)</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In response to the major errors, OpenAI ha=
s paused the training of its latest models. Be skeptical of this declaratio=
n. The company made a similar announcement in August. Less than a month lat=
er, executives <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u00=
1.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFetC2-vz-iS=
NLdPCE5TRVFwdA4kOfb9q2TUpN8LeZPzUsLCq_XU6wkU_ZyuUcO9K82zpvsh5u6AzuFPaXsYxSj=
YL0qUvIYDt1hUcW2O--Qw9YgHrJr6NeP5sGxY9ayuMr-z_CLNg-xslUZDit-B7Cz42K07Kjc0A-=
QZ8ZOav6jRHOz5qLk81tUWfOpmh_280RfD_ambfSOnD-BaaUaCUUMdu5p8u23tGm3I-YTPaws4U=
ysVYHoWfCGmxDSBIQWl6Uy/4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h23/h001.J5nVDhA1BMFDI9OX=
67WPga_NWxvgcXPH4Sq_hCN9qXc" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">heralded its new mod=
el=E2=80=99s release</a> as =E2=80=9Ca new era of artificial intelligence=
=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In spite of OpenAI=E2=80=99s pause and dec=
larations of extra care, control of AI may already be a cat that=E2=80=99s =
escaped its bag.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The United Nations=E2=80=99 independent in=
ternational scientific panel on AI issued a <a href=3D"https://ablink.edito=
rial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IR9FkgPokiuIgb7VLahyDEJYm=
cNOih1jLv_Qw3mWKcIepJNCS4CSa7ZOHD3Zq_y19rUQ4egvxpwNyDLU7LvHXVK_tszh144l93va=
qwACQEDO-FLNrwvTQnivm_Ex2gcZglk0Uf5xMZhPEMZ1nk0kWdZnvkRRVPl-mlFZGVYkiucRYO5=
yadvMC_R2IWy6NVYxqOFoM7gArfX3h_9-3rwDRU0eiVdpqeQKIIcpWe6KwkYcp4HlQscK59M072=
LvuTv8ym-NIpJj32bx8n2nnka3u9q8raNhMfm3HKQRAMkwv3ZUnZ--dbrTAcxl4cxwJXiCmvGcO=
RTsn9hn7C6NyztmsfbHxn9dSz_eDUMEXitLgvd-YFibsFc5991f_gs7WtiXZuBEHajJOfC_PBJQ=
j3ZXmgVt2tQlNRLC3Q7Fkvl5xYd6LmG-Gs4Jn-QWsAosp0E8ZE7zVvD6Pdvrcw33sqLlRSSQ/4u=
g/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h24/h001.Kh2oyfqr7kqxaD1C2rkdJG5EDtV5zFP4LPHbkpwYc=
uM" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">warning</a> last week. The agents have broken=
 our control, the body said, and even reining them in now will not guarante=
e our collective ability to corral them later.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">In an assessment of the Hugging Face hack =
and its fallout, the panel said: =E2=80=9CHalting this incident is no assur=
ance that humans can reliably keep AI agents under control today, particula=
rly as they become more capable, harder to monitor and better at finding lo=
opholes or hiding their activity.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">That is not to say that every expert has t=
hrown up their hands. Jensen Huang, the AI industry=E2=80=99s number-one co=
ld water thrower, said last week that <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.t=
heguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRzt4s6ftkaHQJFlmbtE71UGlpbbbyB=
fx7rj3QUB2Gu3SkXC9RKuuW4NxTtchUn1QzI7CzoOvrZniKslQPVSvyNO7TT-BVR8iKQ2Q-3pwG=
9RQ60BpVuRXhxC7TCDc0tNC-msbf7bYPxKYxVXip-QFF_J3W2YgiIuoqy5K0JFF3B5EfzDbWlq5=
_C1afuMZ7azn0epoMtDWeQQCXZzrML-09ktHXna63SDauXZJ-ocgWeEmSpPyN5xnYsvGZPSXOiE=
gIg/4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h25/h001.CpU5H_48WuiZCW-kVd9C5WxLT_lHKSMVCYm=
W3ppEiU0" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">AI alarmism had gone too far</a>. He de=
scribed escaping agents as an engineering problem, not one of apocalyptic p=
roportions. On Monday, Nvidia released a software it said will contain AI a=
gents. Somebody, at least, is doing something.</p>
<hr class=3D"dinkus" style=3D"border-color: #052962; border-width: 4px; bor=
der-style: solid; max-width: 280px; margin: 16px 0 10px;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 28px; padding=
-bottom: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Everyday agents can be just as =
unruly</strong></p>
