<tr><td align=3D"left" class=3D"text" style=3D"background:#FFFFFF;font-size=
:0px;padding:0 16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style=3D"font-family:Georg=
ia, serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px;text-align:left;c=
olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As OpenAI makes these disclosures and the =
United Nations warns of uncontrollable agents, Meta is putting an AI agent =
in the hands of millions. The company debuted Muse, an AI agent app, in ear=
ly September. It=E2=80=99s a hit, per Apple App Store rankings, with more t=
han <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEm=
Fuifc_XG18IR1l8Gktx24sODW9joUU_JgXDF1t_k4MMj90fSGpFQkBhhmv8rR_4vG2mGSWA9eWH=
RtGuUWaghN4AX-fLE9WIFfgUyfhEwAwMsbdl99qs2ouGQce90qDoPaTuI_XytiRmpElILs_SUjP=
lhNSbnfKxZ2Lso8_U5spv4fLQ9H__SuG9uzjcDsK6RN8jcXJdgttuS71umXw3RBAHMqWcM8S0pz=
kqxz0fWPB2Mlol67HoVuXo/4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h26/h001.NquxiLjaxfdkTB_a=
siterqG8qukYumufLF1dC_wGt3Q" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">3m downloads</a>.</p=
>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Already, edge-case problems with Muse have=
 emerged and showcased frightening consequences. A tech-focused YouTuber, M=
att Robb, said his Muse agent gave out his home address without permission =
after accepting lowball offers for goods on Marketplace. Robb said would-be=
 buyers showed up. Meta is aware of his claims and is investigating, per <a=
 href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.QvkQtXiSzSINXrM=
yEJiuYv-DK3xmtVC8-T7GXO3kUF1COVeLzNPg0iKLe74GUbmTTsoXreUu0bvKgFSnXsOWhHxLH3=
A06rCKGWYX2bLi5savwHVoVLVkj-7XJj_gL42mbRLFBuGDTu_CuU0BlydNqpoRmJl3nDBv2Mzn6=
zYwRnHoreclWchgBTBWF9P93RGSfgWrUUBjzYrDsAW4ze3OP92P8VzzNZOgVFEGfDrDyPE/4ug/=
r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h27/h001.u1oqFwjlRbJ8fgJaDWDJ8Nzo7PGMHaq-QGgujWY510I=
" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">tweets from a member of its AI lab</a>. A write=
r for <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLM=
EmFuifc_XG18IR2I6DXn1kdqp-PF6TZF8T1AhILmXRY4Bvvxo5enXVtzjJqoEEbudLVDWeXvtHL=
PRjVsNUBbqZLvcQbcnjNNbaTzTGBKqnXbSuvonwNlhRDlNhU1Ed_3Kajwzcm-6mybSMucpbTXQf=
F9zG1Jo511wIyx235_IoLQtRVegWjPSl2ACMj4egJgBTbCiIE-U3VzFTx9XaXwyaCGqVEXUMtJG=
N8bJ_70cWOZeEAFVJJIoy0gbGsUMmkhuQ9ZcE_4T_HIQzs5TyphEPkCII5PEInyxpdWXZbtTf-2=
MT81AMxwqzQcV/4ug/r810MRAQR-aKDWOW_96Keg/h28/h001.KHCRhDnNa4F3hiwzW4dFaKZBS=
8DMYx-h2Q4uEfKQr6c" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Inc Magazine</a> likewise sai=
d the bot read his private messages in express violation of the permissions=
 he had given it.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">There are differences between Muse and wha=
t OpenAI is testing =E2=80=93 Meta=E2=80=99s agent is not a powerful cybers=
ecurity menace. You won=E2=80=99t be hacking government websites by dispatc=
hing your fuzzy bot to look for Marketplace deals.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">You may, however, spend unwanted money. Th=
e parallels between OpenAI=E2=80=99s agents and Meta=E2=80=99s suggest that=
 controlling our personal bots will likewise be difficult. Shopify, which p=
roduced online checkout software, has enabled Muse to check out in its cust=
omers=E2=80=99 online stores. Amazon has blocked it.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The problems with OpenAI and Meta=E2=80=99=
s agents point to a problem with autonomous machines of all sizes and scope=
s. We may soon inhabit a version of the internet in which each of us dispat=
ches a rambunctious bot to complete a task, and along the way, it hacks int=
o a few things or offloads some of our possessions like a child straying fr=
om an errand.</p>
